# 行尾策略：仓库内存 LF，检出也保持 LF
# 说明：本机 core.autocrlf=true（来自 Codex 运行时自带 gitconfig），
#       不锁死会产生「LF will be replaced by CRLF」警告，且 server/ 将来部署到
#       Linux 时 CRLF 会直接破坏 shell 脚本，故在仓库层统一为 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本仍用 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.glb  binary
*.gltf binary
*.fbx  binary
*.zip  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.wav  binary
# 模型权重（不进仓库，规则见 .gitignore）
*.safetensors binary
*.onnx binary
*.ckpt binary
*.pt   binary
*.bin  binary